  "Its west entry could not be removed by the ordinary path: the clean-checkout test compares local commits against the upstream, and the upstream had just been deleted, so all 20 read as absent. Proved instead that ZERO local commits fall outside the bundle (whose tip equals the checkout's), removed the checkout, then unregistered with ALLOW_ABSENT=1 and the reason recorded."
